/erl-entrance env_0054_ecommerce_marketplace_operator N=5 M=2 — Buyer and seller support of a third-party ecommerce marketplace (B2C buyers, B2B sellers): buyers hold memberships and sellers hold selling plans by tier with fulfillment services, booking orders, returns and guarantee claims, refunds and replacements, seller fees, payouts and reserves, storage fees, review disputes and account actions. Prioritize the realism of the scenario when generating the environment, tasks, and documents: everything, especially the associated settings of prerequisite tasks, must conform to real-world scenarios and existing logic rather than being fabricated. Output folder: env/env_0054_ecommerce_marketplace_operator. This is an unattended run: never ask questions or wait for confirmation.
